# Store text as LF in the repository, check out with the platform's native
# ending. The sources are a mix today (some written with CRLF by Visual
# Studio, some with LF), and this keeps that from ever showing up as a diff.
* text=auto

# Never touch these.
# BKCLAUDE.HED is Shift_JIS with CRLF on purpose - a 1990s BBS upload header,
# meant to be readable on the machines of the day - so git must not
# re-encode or re-terminate it.
*.HED binary
*.dll binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
